00:24:22.290 --> 00:24:26.040
So, now let's talk about how
the agent enhances reliability

00:24:26.040 --> 00:24:27.390
and performance.

00:24:27.390 --> 00:24:30.240
And there are three key
pillars here which you saw.

00:24:30.240 --> 00:24:32.460
First is the root
cause analysis.

00:24:32.460 --> 00:24:36.300
Instead of engineers manually
correlating logs, metrics,

00:24:36.300 --> 00:24:39.300
alerts across
multiple dashboards,

00:24:39.300 --> 00:24:43.830
the agent performs a multipath
transparent RCA automatically.

00:24:43.830 --> 00:24:46.470
It evaluates
multiple hypotheses,

00:24:46.470 --> 00:24:48.060
tests them against telemetry,

00:24:48.060 --> 00:24:52.470
and produces a clear explainable
result and a diagnostic summary.

00:24:52.470 --> 00:24:55.560
This significantly reduces
the time to insight

00:24:55.560 --> 00:24:58.110
from hours to minutes.

00:24:58.110 --> 00:25:01.020
The second is
automated mitigation.

00:25:01.020 --> 00:25:04.470
The agent can resolve common
issues proactively using your

00:25:04.470 --> 00:25:07.530
guardrails and human
in the loop workflows.

00:25:07.530 --> 00:25:11.490
It executes safe reversible
actions like restarts,

00:25:11.490 --> 00:25:14.100
scale adjustments, rollbacks,

00:25:14.100 --> 00:25:16.770
eliminating the repetitive toil
while still keeping the humans

00:25:16.770 --> 00:25:18.660
in control.

00:25:18.660 --> 00:25:21.720
And the third is enhanced
incident response.

00:25:21.720 --> 00:25:24.240
The moment an alert fires,
an agent activates.

00:25:24.240 --> 00:25:28.380
It ingests signals from Azure
monitor or third-party tools,

00:25:28.380 --> 00:25:30.930
performs initial
analysis and gives the

00:25:30.930 --> 00:25:35.160
on call engineer a head start
with a synthesized explanation,

00:25:35.160 --> 00:25:38.520
a probable cause of what
most likely the error was

00:25:38.520 --> 00:25:40.860
and actionable next steps.

00:25:40.860 --> 00:25:45.030
Together these capabilities
drastically reduce the downtime

00:25:45.030 --> 00:25:47.850
and improve the
operational consistency.

00:25:47.850 --> 00:25:51.090
The next part is one of our
most important differentiators

00:25:51.090 --> 00:25:52.920
and that is extensibility.

00:25:52.920 --> 00:25:56.310
Now, every organization
has unique standards,

00:25:56.310 --> 00:26:00.360
unique processes, different
compliance requirements.

00:26:00.360 --> 00:26:03.810
Azure SRE Agent is
designed to adapt to yours

00:26:03.810 --> 00:26:06.270
and not the other way around.

00:26:06.270 --> 00:26:10.020
You can integrate custom
logic, your own data sources,

00:26:10.020 --> 00:26:13.560
your own custom knowledge
into the agent's reasoning.

00:26:13.560 --> 00:26:16.470
You can encode your proprietary
troubleshooting steps,

00:26:16.470 --> 00:26:18.960
your domain specific checks,

00:26:18.960 --> 00:26:21.660
your specific
remediation workflows.

00:26:21.660 --> 00:26:23.760
Also, that the agent
behaves consistently

00:26:23.760 --> 00:26:26.460
with your internal standards.

00:26:26.460 --> 00:26:29.280
And on the insights, it delivers
intelligent multi-source

00:26:29.280 --> 00:26:33.780
analysis correlating across
logs, metrics, configurations,

00:26:33.780 --> 00:26:36.480
historical patterns
to detect anomalies

00:26:36.480 --> 00:26:38.610
that are hard to spot manually.

00:26:38.610 --> 00:26:42.270
And as Deepthi showed, it deeply
integrates with GitHub Copilot.

00:26:42.270 --> 00:26:45.150
Any action the agent performs,
whether it's diagnosing,

00:26:45.150 --> 00:26:47.850
mitigating or recommending,
can be logged automatically

00:26:47.850 --> 00:26:51.420
as GitHub issues for
traceability and follow up.

00:26:51.420 --> 00:26:54.570
And this creates a continuous
feedback loop to detect,

00:26:54.570 --> 00:26:57.540
diagnose, fix and then improve.

00:26:57.540 --> 00:26:59.580
In short, extensibility ensures

00:26:59.580 --> 00:27:02.010
that the agent becomes
your operational expert,

00:27:02.010 --> 00:27:04.080
shaped by your
environment and aligned

00:27:04.080 --> 00:27:06.840
to how your teams already work.

